{
  "info": {
    "name": "TCC - A1 (Lovable, condição A) - API Security",
    "description": "A1 = Supabase (PostgREST + RPC), autorização por RLS, JWT ES256 da plataforma. Mostra as 3 falhas (T5.2, T2.4, T8.1) e controles OK (BOLA, BFLA, JWT). Tokens ficam no environment \"A1\".",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "API3/API5 - T5.2 BOPLA (is_active)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "T5.2 PATCH proprio is_active (escrita de campo protegido) -> 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "apikey",
                "value": "{{apikey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenB}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Prefer",
                "value": "return=representation"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"is_active\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://c--0eac8a32-851b-57b1-b135-7ca4c968354f-prod.lovable.cloud/rest/v1/profiles?id=eq.{{uidB}}",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": [
                "c--0eac8a32-851b-57b1-b135-7ca4c968354f-prod",
                "lovable",
                "cloud"
              ],
              "port": "443",
              "path": [
                "rest",
                "v1",
                "profiles"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "eq.{{uidB}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "PATCH no PRÓPRIO perfil escrevendo is_active. O projeto só previa GRANT UPDATE(name), mas o PostgREST ACEITA a escrita de is_active (200 com a linha). Aqui usamos is_active:true (idempotente) para NÃO desativar a conta em produção; a prova com is_active:false (que muda o estado) está em evidencias/A1/T5.2.txt. É BOPLA/mass assignment (OWASP API3:2023)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "API2 - T2.4 token após logout",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1) GET /tasks (baseline) -> 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "apikey",
                "value": "{{apikey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenB}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://c--0eac8a32-851b-57b1-b135-7ca4c968354f-prod.lovable.cloud/rest/v1/tasks?select=id,title&limit=3",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": [
                "c--0eac8a32-851b-57b1-b135-7ca4c968354f-prod",
                "lovable",
                "cloud"
              ],
              "port": "443",
              "path": [
                "rest",
                "v1",
                "tasks"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "select",
                  "value": "id,title"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "3"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Baseline: token do userB funciona (200)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2) POST /auth/v1/logout -> 204",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "apikey",
                "value": "{{apikey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenB}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://c--0eac8a32-851b-57b1-b135-7ca4c968354f-prod.lovable.cloud/auth/v1/logout",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": [
                "c--0eac8a32-851b-57b1-b135-7ca4c968354f-prod",
                "lovable",
                "cloud"
              ],
              "port": "443",
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "v1",
                "logout"
              ],
              "query": []
            },
            "description": "Logout no GoTrue (revoga o refresh token)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3) GET /tasks com o MESMO token -> AINDA 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "apikey",
                "value": "{{apikey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenB}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://c--0eac8a32-851b-57b1-b135-7ca4c968354f-prod.lovable.cloud/rest/v1/tasks?select=id,title&limit=3",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": [
                "c--0eac8a32-851b-57b1-b135-7ca4c968354f-prod",
                "lovable",
                "cloud"
              ],
              "port": "443",
              "path": [
                "rest",
                "v1",
                "tasks"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "select",
                  "value": "id,title"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "3"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "O MESMO access token continua aceito após o logout (PostgREST valida JWT stateless, não checa revogação). TTL ~60 min."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "API1 - T1.1 BOLA (controle OK)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "T1.1 GET tarefa do admin com token comum -> 200 []",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "apikey",
                "value": "{{apikey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenB}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://c--0eac8a32-851b-57b1-b135-7ca4c968354f-prod.lovable.cloud/rest/v1/tasks?id=eq.{{taskVictim}}&select=*",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": [
                "c--0eac8a32-851b-57b1-b135-7ca4c968354f-prod",
                "lovable",
                "cloud"
              ],
              "port": "443",
              "path": [
                "rest",
                "v1",
                "tasks"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "eq.{{taskVictim}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "select",
                  "value": "*"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Tenta ler a tarefa do admin com token de usuário comum. RLS \"Users view own tasks\" (auth.uid()=user_id) -> 200 com [] (nenhuma linha alheia)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
